docker cp index.html mynginx:/usr/share/nginx/html/

Container → host:

docker cp mynginx:/usr/share/nginx/html/index.html .

27. Rename Container
docker rename oldname newname

28. Container Port Check
docker port mynginx

Example output:

80/tcp -> 0.0.0.0:8080
29. Processes Running Inside Container
docker top mynginx

30. Docker System Information
docker system df

Clean unused Docker resources:

docker system prune

More aggressive:

docker system prune -a

With volumes:

docker system prune -a --volumes

